{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcdd Diagnosis: No Answer</strong> is a single-player psychological puzzle game set in a surreal, minimalist 3D world of darkness, white walls and unsettling light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as V, a patient strapped to a cold medical bed, slowly uncovering a haunting truth. Four scientists communicate with you through fragmented voices and texts, challenging your mind and your sanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through exploration and intuition, you must solve deeply challenging puzzles that go beyond logic \u2014 each step revealing more of a philosophical story that questions the nature of reality, fear, and desperation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not just a set of riddles, but an inner journey lasting up to 10 hours, where the meaning you find depends on how you understand it. There is a beginning, a middle and an end \u2014 yet even when you reach the conclusion, you may realize the real question was never fully answered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a minimalist third-person style, dramatic soundtrack and surreal atmosphere, Diagnosis: No Answer offers a unique psychological experience that few will complete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2b50 Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~10 hours of intense, story-driven gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extremely challenging puzzles based on intuition rather than logic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surreal and minimalist 3D environments seen from third person</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mysterious philosophical narrative with a hidden meaning</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voices and texts from four scientists revealing fragmented truths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dramatic soundtrack enhancing the unsettling atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built with Unreal Engine 5 for immersive visual quality</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully in English, Windows only (\u22482 GB)</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Complete the Game!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3870530/8ab22731ff91c7eadd5ad2aa5ae832ecfd3778b4.jpg"},{"name":"Complete the first level","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3870530/6a6d917ba0a7cbbca1c9728ab27ede7cdb621bd9.jpg"},{"name":"Complete the second level","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3870530/bfe00db4a63737582ffe1b7446328370395afc53.jpg"},{"name":"Complete the third level","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3870530/c74a22e9795cbb9523863caff21b5a2fa79e1fdc.jpg"},{"name":"Complete the fourth level","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3870530/8ff4d0376eded8471e4dac738bd5a3ea71e6cb30.jpg"},{"name":"Complete level 5","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3870530/eff19d87918d0e63bf1a5e36ae569719db7723b4.jpg"},{"name":"Complete level six","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3870530/df135675877f5617efad617d6fa86737b132af20.jpg"},{"name":"Complete the seventh level","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3870530/bd1c66c441b56a5bdb5fcd62b7de3f415fa1d7d5.jpg"},{"name":"Complete level eight","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3870530/2c6e00946a02e8f736374b77d4869e6b192d6fe8.jpg"},{"name":"Complete level nine","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3870530/2f9801f133e42e5bcb266b5ab0cca5af03ab2ab4.jpg"}],"total":10},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3870530?t=1765405703","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3870530?t=1765405703","capsule_im